   "class": "sc-fa539dd8-3 bGsoaN text-content",
   "landmarks": [
    "aside",
    "main"
   ],
   "textLength": 221,
   "text": "$TNSR sits around Tensor and Solana’s NFT trading ecosystem. That places the token around a market where speed, liquidity and professional trading tools matter much more than they did during the earliest collectible boom.",
