   "landmarks": [
    "aside",
    "main"
   ],
   "textLength": 211,
   "text": "The broader lesson is that NFTs became a real market structure instead of one endless mint cycle. Traders care about execution, collections care about distribution and marketplaces compete for actual order flow.",
